                                                "sense_id": "2a2353e6-a769-3e67-a487-ce625281040a",
                                                "text": "Pathfinders are trained to improve the viability of potential planets, initiate first contact with unknown species, find suitable outpost sites, and handle any external threats before the first colonist touches soil. The presence of a Pathfinder is a reassurance that a planet can be settled safely and with a high expectation of success."
